VulkanGPU - reusable C++17 VulkanWrapper resources and compute.
  gpu/gpu.hpp              umbrella API
  gpu/resource.hpp         move-only owned buffer/image and creation helpers
  gpu/buffer.*             owned GPU buffer, mapped uploads
  gpu/image.*              owned GPU image/view
  gpu/descriptors.*        owned arbitrary descriptor layouts/pools/sets
  gpu/shader.*             SPIR-V shader modules
  gpu/pipeline.*           compute pipeline layout
  gpu/compute.*            generic compute dispatch
  gpu/transfer.*           buffer copy/fill operations
  gpu/upload.hpp           asynchronous fenced staging
  gpu/texture_cache.*      RGBA8 residency cache
  gpu/graph.*              explicit accesses, pass barriers
  gpu/culler.*             frustum sphere compaction to indirect draws
  gpu/shaders/cull.comp    reference shader

owned_buffer and owned_image wrap VulkanWrapper resource structs with RAII,
move-only semantics, and raw handle compatibility. create_buffer/create_image
return owned resources. Ensure all referencing GPU work has finished before
replacing or destroying them.

Host owns device, queue, swapchain and frame fences. Texture replacement and
descriptor writes cannot race in-flight reads. Culling descriptors use binding
0 transforms, 1 sphere bounds, 2 visible IDs and 3 indirect draw arguments.
The caller supplies compiled SPIR-V. Culling is not occlusion culling.

